OL,3,GNEWSAResidents move into social housing
OL,4,Adevelopment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first people have moved into a
OL,7,Fnewly developed tower block that
OL,8,Fprovides social housing for 61
OL,9,Fhouseholds.
OL,11,FConstruction began on Chestnut Tower in
OL,12,FOxford's Blackbird Leys estate in March
OL,13,F2024 as part of wider plans to
OL,14,Fredevelop the neighbourhood, with an
OL,15,Festimated cost of #100m.
OL,17,FA community centre, public square,
OL,18,Flocal shops and 135 more affordable
OL,19,Fhomes are also being built, with a
OL,20,Fsecond tower block due to open next
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
