OL,3,GNEWSAResidents move into social housing
OL,4,Adevelopment
OL,5,
OL,6,FLinda Smith, the lead member for
OL,7,FHousing at Oxford City Council said "a
OL,8,Fsmall rise in the budget" will be
OL,9,Fneeded to complete the project.
